---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import iyapLogo from "../../assets/logos/iyap.webp";
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20">
  <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-navy-950">Writing</h1>
  <div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-4">
    <span class="flex h-14 w-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-white p-2 ring-1 ring-navy-950/10">
      <Image
        src={iyapLogo}
        alt="International Youth Alliance for Peace logo"
        width={80}
        class="max-h-full max-w-full object-contain"
      />
    </span>
    <p class="text-navy-800">
      I'll be publishing my writing here soon, starting with a piece on
      education equity written for the International Youth Alliance for
      Peace.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
